#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Ku saabsan Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti waxaa loo naqshadeeyay inay noqoto xal dhammaystiran oo jaantus-samayn ah oo ku salaysan Kaydka Xogta Taxanaha Waqtiga ee RRDtool (TSDB) iyo xalka Jaantusyada. Ujeedkeedu waa inay fududayso shaqada Maamulaha Shabakadda iyadoo daryeelaysa dhammaan faahfaahinta muhiimka ah ee lagama maarmaanka u ah abuurista Jaantusyo macno leh."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Fadlan booqo %swebsaydhka rasmiga ah ee Cacti%s si aad u hesho macluumaad ku saabsan sida loo isticmaalo Cacti, helitaanka taageero, iyo cusboonaysiin."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Horumariyayaasha Firfircoon"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Horumariyayaasha ka shaqeeya Cacti, Qaab-dhismeedkeeda, Dukumeentiyadeeda iyo Soo-saaryada Mustaqbalka."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Xusidda Sharafta Leh"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Wax-ku-biiriyayaasha Dukumeentiyada, Hubinta Tayada (QA), Baakadeynta, Madallada iyo boggeenna YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Xubnihii Hore ee Sharafta Leh"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Xubnihii Kooxdii asalka ahayd ee Cacti oo tan iyo markaas u gudbay shaqooyin kale. Waxaan sii wadnaa inaan u rajayno wanaag."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Mahadcelin"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Mahadcelin gaar ah oo aad u weyn waxay u socotaa %sTobi Oetiker%s, abuuraha %sRRDtool%s iyo %sMRTG%s oo aadka loo jecel yahay."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Isticmaalayaasha Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Gaar ahaan qof kasta oo waqti u huray inuu sameeyo warbixin cilad, ama si kale uga caawiyay xallinta dhibaatooyinka la xiriira Cacti. Sidoo kale qof kasta oo gacan ka geystay taageeridda Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Shatiga"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti waxay ku shaqeysaa shatiga GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Barnaamijkani waa software xor ah; dib baad u qaybin kartaa ama wax ka beddeli kartaa iyadoo la raacayo shuruudaha Shatiga Guud ee Dadweynaha ee GNU (GNU General Public License) sida ay u daabacday Hay'adda Free Software Foundation; nooca 2aad ee Shatiga, ama (doorashadaada) nooc kasta oo ka dambeeya."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Barnaamijkan waxaa loo qaybiyaa iyadoo la rajaynayo inuu faa'iido yeelan doono, laakiin MA LAHA WAX DAMMAANAD AH; xitaa ma laha dammaanad maldahan oo ku saabsan GANACSI-KU-HABBOONAANTA ama KU-HABBOONAANTA UJEEDDO GAAR AH. Eeg Shatiga Guud ee Dadweynaha ee GNU wixii faahfaahin dheeraad ah."

