#: include/global_settings.php:436
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Habka Ogolaanshaha Jaantuska"

#: include/global_settings.php:437
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Waxaa jira afar hab oo lagu go'aamiyo Ogolaanshaha Jaantuska ee Isticmaalaha.  Midka koowaad waa 'Permissive' (Ogolaansho Fudud).  Dejinta 'Permissive', Isticmaaluhu wuxuu u baahan yahay oo keliya gelitaanka Jaantuska, Qalabka, ama Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska si uu u helo Jaantusyada khuseeya.  Dejinta 'Restrictive' (Xaddidan), Isticmaaluhu waa inuu lahaadaa gelitaanka Jaantuska, Qalabka, iyo Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska si uu u helo Jaantuska.  Labadan hab ee hore waxay leeyihiin dhibaatooyin ballaarin oo ku saabsan rakibaadaha aadka u waaweyn.  Sidaa darteed, laba ikhtiyaar oo dheeri ah ayaa la heli karaa.  Waxay kala yihiin 'Device Based' (Ku Saleysan Qalabka), taas oo macnaheedu yahay haddii aad gelitaan u leedahay Qalabka, waxaad heleysaa gelitaanka Jaantusyadiisa.  Ugu dambeyntiina 'Graph Template Based' (Ku Saleysan Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska), taas oo macnaheedu yahay haddii aad gelitaan u leedahay 'Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska' waxaad heleysaa gelitaanka dhammaan Jaantusyada Qalabka ee Qaab-dhismeedkaas."

#: include/global_settings.php:441
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Ogolaansho Fudud"

#: include/global_settings.php:442
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Xaddidan"

#: include/global_settings.php:443
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Ku Saleysan Qalabka"

