#: include/global_settings.php:465
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Si caadi ah caawimaadda bogga Cacti waxay ku taal docs.cacti.net.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, haddii nidaamkaagu uusan lahayn gelitaan Internet, waxaad soo dejisan kartaa dukumeentiyada si maxalli ah qaab HTML ah oo aad ku martigelin kartaa meesha 'docs' ee adeegahaaga Cacti.  Haddii aad doorato inaad adeegsato oo keliya goobta maxalliga ah ee dukumeentiyada caawimaadda bogga, calaamadee sanduuqan."

#: include/global_settings.php:470
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Xaqiijinta Tirtiridda"

#: include/global_settings.php:471
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Weydii isticmaalaha ka hor inta aan shayga la tirtirin."

#: include/global_settings.php:476
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Dejinta Hore ee Ilaalinta Ilaha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php:477
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, Cacti waxay u dejin doontaa Badhanka Raadiyaha in la Tirtiro Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Jaantuska marka laga saarayo Jaantusyada.  Fiiro gaar ah: Cacti ma oggolaan doonto ka saarista Ilaha Xogta haddii lagu isticmaalo Jaantusyo kale."

#: include/global_settings.php:482
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Furitaanka Tooska ah ee Jaantusyada"

#: include/global_settings.php:483
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, Cacti ma xiri doonto Jaantusyada.  Tani waxay oggolaanaysaa wax ka beddel gacan ah oo dhakhso badan oo lagu sameeyo Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Jaantus."

#: include/global_settings.php:488
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Qari Dashboard-ka Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php:489
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Loogu talagalay in lala isticmaalo Taageerada Xiriiriyaha Dibadda ee Cacti.  Adigoo adeegsanaya dejintan, waxaad qarin kartaa Dashboard-ka Cacti, si aad u muujiso boggaaga gaarka ah oo keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php:494
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Daar Jiid-oo-Dhig (Drag-N-Drop)"

#: include/global_settings.php:495
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah wejiyada Cacti waxay taageeraan Jiid-oo-Dhig (Drag-N-Drop).  Haddii la calaamadeeyo ikhtiyaarkan waa la daari doonaa.  Fiiro gaar ah: Isticmaalayaasha aragga naafada ka ah, ikhtiyaarkan waa la damin karaa."

#: include/global_settings.php:500
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Amniga Goobta"

#: include/global_settings.php:505
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Ku Qasab Xiriirrada HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php:506
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, isku day kasta oo lagu galo Cacti waxaa loo weecin doonaa HTTPS si loo xaqiijiyo amni sare."

#: include/global_settings.php:511
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "U Oggolow HTTPS-ka Aan Ammaanka Ahayn ee Xog-uruuriyaha Fog"

#: include/global_settings.php:512
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "U oggolow isticmaalka Shahaadooyinka Is-saxiixay oo u oggolow in magaca martigeliyaha ee Shahaadadu uu ka duwanaado kan Xog-uruuriyaha Fog."

#: include/global_settings.php:517
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "U Oggolow Xarfaha Gaarka ah ee Aan Ammaanka Ahayn Hababka Gelinta Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php:518
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Taariikh ahaan, maamulayaasha Cacti waxay abuureen Habab Gelinta Xogta oo fudud kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan amarrada sida \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" si ay u matalaan qiime tiro ah oo loogu isticmaalo Jaantusyada Cacti.  Noocyadii hore ee Cacti, tani waa la oggolaa.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, tani waa dhaqan aan ammaan ahayn maadaama ay u furto albaab isticmaalayaasha saddexaad si ay u daabacaan Qaab-dhismeedyo Xog oo aan ammaan ahayn.  Cacti-ga casriga ah, noocyada dhaqamadan oo kale waa in laga fogaado.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waxaan bixinnaa ikhtiyaarkan haddii aad leedahay Habab Gelinta Xogta oo duug ah kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan Xarfahan Gaarka ah ee aan ammaanka ahayn oo aadan weli u beddelin qoraallo maxalli ah oo ku jira galka 'scripts'.  Marka aan ikhtiyaarkan la calaamadeyn, Cacti waxay xaddiddaa xarfaha gaarka ah ee qaabka shell-ka sida calaamadaha xigashada, qaansooyinka qaloocan, xariiqaha toosan, diillimaha dambe, iyo calaamadaha backtick.  Cacti waxay sii waddaa inay oggolaato calaamadaha ka-weyn iyo ka-yar waxyaabaha sida <path_cacti> iyo cabbirrada gelinta, laakiin haddii aan ikhtiyaarkan la calaamadeyn, taasi waa xadka isticmaalkooda la oggol yahay."

#: include/global_settings.php:524
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Siyaasadda Qoraalka Amniga Nuxurka (CSP)"

#: include/global_settings.php:525
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Waxay maamushaa siyaasadda CSP ee script-src.  Hababka Nonce, Kordhinnada Cacti ee adeegsada JavaScript-ka dhex-ku-jira waa inay ku daraan sifada nonce ee ka timaadda hawsha gudaha ah ee Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Haddii kale, qoraalladaas waxaa xannibi doona biraawsarka.  Hadda, Cacti waxay oggolaataa oo keliya in laga warbixiyo Kordhinnada Cacti ee aan si sax ah u adeegsan Habka Nonce.  Mustaqbalka, waxaan u oggolaan doonnaa Maamulayaasha inay ka xannibaan kordhinnadaas inay adeegsadaan JavaScript-kooda dhex-ku-jira haddii aysan adeegsanayn Nonce-yada."

#: include/global_settings.php:528
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Oggolow JavaScript-ka gudaha ah ee aan Nonce lahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php:529
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Oggolow labadaba unsafe-eval iyo JavaScript-ka gudaha ah ee aan Nonce lahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php:530
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Habka Nonce - Warbixin Keliya"

#: include/global_settings.php:534 include/global_settings.php:549
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI-ga Warbixinta Xadgudubka CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php:535
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL-ka ay biraawsarradu u diraan (POST) warbixinnada xadgudubka CSP marka la joogo hababka nonce-report iyo nonce. Meel bannaan u daa si loo adeegsado <url_path>/csp_report.php. Waa inuu ka koobnaadaa xarfo URL oo ammaan ah keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php:541
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Ilaha Kale ee Amniga Nuxurka (Content-Security)"

#: include/global_settings.php:542
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Magacyada domain-ka ee meel bannaan lagu kala soocay oo loo oggolaanayo in laga galo meel ka baxsan Adeegaha Webka laftiisa. Tani waxay muhiim u tahay isticmaalayaasha doorta inay isticmaalaan CDN, ama goob martigelin ah. Iluhu waxay yeelan karaan calaamado guud (wildcards) tusaale ahaan: *.mydomain.com, ama borotokool, tusaale ahaan: https://*.example.com. Ilahan Kale waxay ka kooban yihiin noocyada Sawirka, CSS iyo JavaScript keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php:550
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL-ka ay biraawsarradu u diraan (POST) warbixinnada xadgudubka CSP marka la joogo hababka nonce-report iyo nonce. Meel bannaan u daa si loo adeegsado /cacti/csp_report.php ee xididka rakibaadda. Waa inuu ka koobnaadaa xarfo URL oo ammaan ah keliya."

#: include/global_settings.php:562
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Daar Samaynta Jaantuska ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php:563
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la damiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma samayn doono wax Jaantus ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejinta Qalabka si looga fogaado samaynta Jaantusyo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. Kicinta Xeerarka Otomaatigga ee gacanta ah weli way suurtogal tahay."

#: include/global_settings.php:568
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Daar Samaynta Shayga Geedka ee Otomaatigga ah"

#: include/global_settings.php:569
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Marka la damiyo, Otomaatigga Cacti si firfircoon uma samayn doono wax Shay Geed ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejinta Qalabka ama Jaantuska si looga fogaado samaynta Gelitaanno Geed oo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. Kicinta Xeerarka ee gacanta ah weli way suurtogal tahay."

#: include/global_settings.php:573
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Loo Diro Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php:574
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo dirayo Iimayllada Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu sheegin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii goobtan ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga midkood bannaanaado, Cacti wuxuu adeegsan doonaa akoonka Iimaylka ee Maamulayaasha Ugu Muhiimsan ee Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php:580
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Magaca Soo Diraha Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php:581
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Magaca Iimaylka ee loo adeegsanayo Iimayllada Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu sheegin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii goobtan ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga midkood bannaanaado, Cacti wuxuu adeegsan doonaa Magaca Soo Diraha ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php:588
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Iimaylka Soo Diraha Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga"

#: include/global_settings.php:589
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Cinwaanka Iimaylka ee loo adeegsanayo Iimayllada Ogeysiiska Otomaatigga haddii aan lagu sheegin heerka Shabakadda Otomaatigga. Haddii goobtan ama qiimaha Shabakadda Otomaatigga midkood bannaanaado, Cacti wuxuu adeegsan doonaa Cinwaanka Iimaylka Soo Diraha ee caadiga ah ee nidaamka."

#: include/global_settings.php:595
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Dejinta Caadiga ah ee Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska"

#: include/global_settings.php:601
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Tijaabi Isha Xogta ee Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska"

#: include/global_settings.php:602
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad tijaabiso Ilaha Xogta ka hor intaan la samayn Qaab-dhismeedyada Jaantuska ee cusub iyo kuwa dhowaan la soo dejiyay. Marka Tijaabada Ilaha Xogta ay shidan tahay, haddii Isha Xogtu aysan soo celin xog sax ah, Jaantuska lama samayn doono. Dejintani waxay muhiim tahay haddii aad rabto inaad yeelato Qaab-dhismeed Qalab oo guud kaas oo ku dari kara Qaab-dhismeedyo Jaantus oo badan kuwaas oo si xulasho ah loo adeegsan karo iyadoo ku xiran sifooyinka Qalabka laftiisa. Fiiro gaar ah: Haddii aad leedahay qoraal (script) muddo dheer socda sida Isha Xogta, waqtiga lagu sameeyo Jaantusyada wuu kordhi doonaa."

#: include/global_settings.php:607
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Qaabka Sawirka ee caadiga ah ee loo adeegsanayo dhammaan Qaab-dhismeedyada Jaantuska ee cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php:614
