#: include/global_settings.php:622
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ballaca Jaantuska ee caadiga ah ee loo adeegsanayo dhammaan Qaab-dhismeedyada Jaantuska ee cusub."

