msgstr "Port-ka UDP ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub. Caadiyan waa 161."

#: include/global_settings.php:791
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Waqtiga dhammaadka SNMP ee caadiga ah oo milisekan ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php:799
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Tirada isku-dayga dib-u-celinta SNMP ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub."

#: include/global_settings.php:806
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Helitaanka/Gaaritaanka"

#: include/global_settings.php:812
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Helitaanka/Gaaritaanka caadiga ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub. Habka uu Cacti u adeegsan doono si uu u ogaado haddii Qalabku diyaar u yahay xog-uruurinta. <br><i>FIIRO GAAR AH: Waxaa lagu talinayaa in ugu yaraan had iyo jeer la doorto SNMP.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php:818
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Nooca Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php:819
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Nooca Ping ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php:826
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Port-ka Ping ee caadiga ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub. Iyadoo la adeegsanayo TCP, Cacti wuxuu isku dayi doonaa inuu Syn ku sameeyo port-ka. Iyadoo la adeegsanayo UDP, Cacti wuxuu u baahan yahay xiriir guuleysta, ama khalad ah 'port not reachable' si uu u go'aamiyo in Qalabku shaqeynayo iyo in kale."

#: include/global_settings.php:834
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Qiimaha Waqtiga Dhammaadka Ping ee caadiga ah oo milisekan ah ee dhammaan Qalabka cusub. Qiimaha waqtiga dhammaadka ee loo adeegsanayo SNMP, ICMP, UDP iyo TCP ping-gareynta Qalabka. Ping-yada ICMP waxaa kor loogu wareejin doonaa ilbiriqsiga ugu dhow. Waqtiyada dhammaadka xiriirka TCP iyo UDP ee Windows waxaa maamula nidaamka hawlgalka, sidaas darteedna laguma talinayo Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php:842
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Tirada jeer ee Cacti isku dayi doono inuu ping ku sameeyo Qalab ka hor inta uusan u calaamadin inuu dansan yahay."

