msgstr "Xilliga Ugu Yar ee Cusboonaysiinta"

#: include/global_settings.php:1040
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Tani waa waqtiga ugu yar ee la taageeray ee u dhexeeya cusboonaysiinta Jaantuska.  Qiimahan waxaa sidoo kale loo isticmaalaa in lagu dejiyo sifooyinka qaarkood ee faylka RRD.  Haddii aad haysato Qalab kaydiya xogta oo aan bixin cusboonaysiin waqtiga-dhabta ah, waxaa laga yaabaa inaad u baahato inaad kordhiso Xilliga Ugu Yar ee Cusboonaysiinta ee caadiga ah si looga hortago samaynta Jaantusyo leh daldaloolo."

#: include/global_settings.php:1046
