#: include/global_settings.php:1158
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Saacadaha Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1163
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Bilowga Maalinta Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1164
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Waqtiga ay saacadahaaga shaqadu bilaabmaan. Qaabka: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php:1171
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Dhammaadka Maalinta Shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1172
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Waqtiga ay saacadahaaga shaqadu dhammaadaan. Qaabka: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php:1179
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Qari Maalmaha Fasaxa Todobaadka"

#: include/global_settings.php:1180
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Muuji saacadaha shaqada oo keliya maalmaha shaqada ee todobaadka."

#: include/global_settings.php:1185
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Muuji saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1186
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Ku muuji saacadaha shaqada jaantusyada RRD."

#: include/global_settings.php:1191
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Midabka loo isticmaalo saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1192
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Midabka lagu muujinayo saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1199
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee maalmaha la muujinayo saacadaha shaqada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1200
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Tiradaas maalmaha ka dib, saacadaha shaqada laguma dari doono jaantuska. <br/>La taliyey: 62 maalmood"

#: include/global_settings.php:1215
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Ururinta Xogta waa Daaran tahay"

#: include/global_settings.php:1216
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto inaad gebi ahaanba joojiso habka ururinta xogta, ka saar calaamadda sanduuqan."

#: include/global_settings.php:1222
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Taageerada Wakiilka SNMP waa Daaran tahay"

#: include/global_settings.php:1223
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Haddii ikhtiyaarkan la calaamadeeyo, Cacti waxay ku buuxin doontaa jadwalada Wakiilka SNMP macluumaadka Qalabka iyo nidaamka Cacti. Ma daarayso Wakiilka SNMP laftiisa."

#: include/global_settings.php:1228
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Nooca Ururiyaha (Poller)"

#: include/global_settings.php:1229
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Nooca ururiyaha la isticmaalayo. Dejintani waxay dhaqan geli doontaa xilliga ururinta xiga."

#: include/global_settings.php:1235
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Xilliga Iswaafajinta Ururiyaha"

#: include/global_settings.php:1236
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Xilliga iswaafajinta ururinta ee caadiga ah ee la isticmaalo marka la abuurayo ururiye. Dejintani waxay saamayn doontaa inta jeer ee la hubiyo lana cusboonaysiiyo ururiyeyaasha fogfog."

#: include/global_settings.php:1243
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Xilliga ururinta xogta ee la isticmaalo. Dejintani waxay saamayn doontaa inta jeer ee faylasha RRD la hubiyo lana cusboonaysiiyo. <strong><u>FIIRO GAAR AH: Haddii aad beddesho qiimahan, waa inaad dib u buuxisaa kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee ururiyaha. Haddii aad sidaas samayn weydo, waxay keeni kartaa xog lunta.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php:1249
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Xilliga Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php:1250
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Inta jeer ee la bilaabayo ururiyaha xogta Cacti. Waxaad isticmaali kartaa crontab, hawl qorshaysan (ee Windows), ama adeegga cactid systemd si aad u maamusho bilaabista ururiyaha xogta Cacti. Tilmaamaha isticmaalka cactid daemon, dib u eeg faylka README.md ee ku jira galka service."

#: include/global_settings.php:1256
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Isu-dheellitirka Culayska Habraacyada"

#: include/global_settings.php:1257
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan, Cacti waxay isku dayi doontaa inay isu-dheellitirto culayska habraac kasta oo ururiye ah iyadoo si siman u qaybinaysa shayyada ururiyaha habraac kasta."

#: include/global_settings.php:1262
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ballaca Soo-saarka Cilad-bixinta"

#: include/global_settings.php:1263
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan, Cacti waxay hubin doontaa soo-saarka ka badnaada awoodda kaydinta ee Cacti waxayna soo saari doontaa digniin marka ay hesho."

#: include/global_settings.php:1268
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Dami Hubinta Kororka OID"

#: include/global_settings.php:1269
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Waxay maamushaa daminta hubinta kororka OID inta lagu jiro baadhista geedka OID."

#: include/global_settings.php:1274
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Wakiilka Fog"

#: include/global_settings.php:1275
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Muddada, ee ilbiriqsiyo ah, ee adeegaha shabakadda Dhexe ee Cacti uu sugi doono jawaab ka timaadda Ururiyaha Xogta Fog si uu u helo macluumaad kala duwan oo Qalabka ah ka hor inta uusan ka tegin codsiga. Qalabka ku xiran Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee aan ahayn Ururiyaha Xogta Dhexe ee Cacti, Wakiilka Fog waa in loo isticmaalo si loo ururiyo macluumaadka Qalabka."

#: include/global_settings.php:1288
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Cabbirka Soo-qaadista SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php:1289
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Immisa OID ayaa la soo celinayaa codsi snmpbulkwalk kasta? Qalabka leh geedasha SNMP ee waaweyn, kordhinta cabbirkan waxay kordhin doontaa waxqabadka dib-u-tusmaynta ee shabakadda WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php:1308
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Xadka OID ee SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php:1309
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Tirada ugu badan ee caadiga ah ee OID-yada SNMP Get ee la diro codsi snmpget kasta. Qalabka, dejintan waxaa laga maamulaa heerka Qalabka. Waa inaad isticmaashaa dejintan oo keliya marka aad si toos ah ugu isticmaalayso SNMP API-ga Cacti qoraalladaada ama plugins-kaaga."

#: include/global_settings.php:1316
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Dami Nuqul-samaynta Kaydka Kheyraadka"

#: include/global_settings.php:1317
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Sida caadiga ah, Ururiyaha Xogta ee ugu weyn Cacti wuxuu ku kaydin doonaa dhammaan degelka shabakadda iyo plugins-ka Kaydka Kheyraadka. Ka dib, marmar Ururiyeyaasha Xogta Fog waxay isku cusboonaysiin doonaan wixii cusboonaysiin ah ee ka yimaada Ururiyaha Xogta ee ugu weyn Cacti. Kaydkan Kheyraadka wuxuu asal ahaan u oggolaadaa Ururiyeyaasha Xogta Fog inay iskood isu casriyeeyaan. Haddii aadan rabin inaad isticmaasho ikhtiyaarkan, waad damin kartaa adigoo isticmaalaya dejintan."

#: include/global_settings.php:1322
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Dheeraadka ah ee Ururiyaha Xogta"

#: include/global_settings.php:1327
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Diiwaangelinta Xogta Aan Saxda Ahayn"

#: include/global_settings.php:1328
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Sidee baad jeclaan lahayd in loo diiwaangeliyo khaladaadka soo-saarka Ururiyaha Xogta? Ikhtiyaarrada waxaa ka mid ah: 'Faahfaahsan' oo faahfaahisa khalad kasta, 'Soo koobid' oo bixisa tirada khaladaadka soo-saarka Qalab kasta, iyo 'Waxba', oo aan bixin tirada khaladaadka."

#: include/global_settings.php:1333 utilities.php:180
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Soo koobid"

#: include/global_settings.php:1334
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Faahfaahsan"

#: include/global_settings.php:1338
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Tirada Adeegayaasha Qoraalka PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php:1339
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Tirada habraacyada adeegaha qoraalka ee isku mar shaqaynaya habraac Spine kasta. Dejinta u dhaxaysa 1 iyo 15 waa la aqbalay. Qiyaastani way ku caawin doontaa haddii aad waddo dhowr threads iyo qoraallada adeegaha qoraalka waxayna u shaqaysaa oo keliya Ururiyaha Xogta ee Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php:1346
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Qiimaha Waqtiga Dhammaadka Qoraalka iyo Adeegaha Qoraalka"

#: include/global_settings.php:1347
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Waqtiga ugu badan ee Spine uu sugi doono in qoraal dhammaado. Qiimahan waqtiga dhammaadka wuxuu ku cabbiran yahay ilbiriqsiyo wuxuuna u shaqeeyaa oo keliya Ururiyaha Xogta ee Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php:1354
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Dib-u-tusmaynta Joogtada ah ee Dhammaan Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php:1359
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Jadwalka Dib-u-tusmaynta Dhammaan Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php:1360
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Intee in le'eg ayaad rabtaa in Dib-u-tusmayn lagu sameeyo dhammaan Qalabka. Dib-u-tusmayntani waxay dhici doontaa saqda dhexe iyadoo loo eegayo inta jeer ee aad doorato."

#: include/global_settings.php:1366
