msgstr "Xaaladaha uu adeegaha Cacti la kulmayo dhibaatooyin, miyaa Maamulaha Koowaad lagu ogeysiiyaa Iimayl? Akoonka isticmaalaha Cacti ee Maamulaha Koowaad waxaa lagu cayimaa tabta Xaqiijinta ee bogga dejinta Cacti. Sida caadiga ah waa akoonka 'admin'."

