msgstr "Kani waa magaca martigeliyaha/IP-ga Adeegaha SMTP ee aad u diri doonto Iimaylka. Haddii aad rabto badbaado wareegto ah (failover), ku kala saar martigeliyeyaashaada dhibic-iyo-kooma (;)."

