msgstr "Cusboonaysiiyaha RRD ee Heerka Nidaamka"

#: include/global_settings.php:2129
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kahor intaan la nadiifin Cusboonaysiinta RRD ee Dalabka ku Xiran, waa in mar walba la dhammeeyo hal wareeg oo xog-uruurin ah"

#: include/global_settings.php:2134
