#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Waxaad ku jirtaa Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog. Marka uu yahay <b>'khadka ku jira'</b>, waxaad awoodi doontaa inaad aragto oo aad maamusho inta badan Bogga Weyn ee Cacti sidii adigoo isaga si toos ah u galay. Sidoo kale, waxaa muhiim ah in la ogaado in Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog looga baahan yahay inay isticmaalaan astaanta <b>'Cusboonaysiinta Marka la Doono'</b> ee Adeegyada Kordhinta Waxqabadka Cacti, waxaana mar walba kugula talinaynaa isticmaalka Spine. Marka Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog uu yahay <b>'khadka ka maqan'</b>, Bogga Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog wuxuu yeelan doonaa macluumaad aad u yar. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, wuxuu kaydin doonaa dhammaan cusboonaysiinta ilaa Xogta Keydka Weyn ee Cacti iyo Adeegaha Webku ay la xiriiri karaan. Ka dibna wuxuu dib ugu shubi doonaa natiijada shaxda Boost-ka Xogta Keydka Weyn ee Cacti si loo cusboonaysiiyo."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Midna ka mid ah Ku-xirayaasha Aasaasiga ah ee Cacti, ilaa hadda, dib looma naqshadeyn si ay ula shaqeeyaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog. Sidaas darteed, Ku-xirayaasha sida MacTrack iyo HMIB, kuwaas oo u baahan gelitaan toos ah oo qalabka ah, lama shaqayn doonaan Ururiyeyaasha Xogta ee Fog wakhtigan. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, ku-xirayaasha sida Thold way shaqayn doonaan inta uu Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog ku jiro habka <b>'khadka ku jira'</b>."

