#: lib/installer.php:2119
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Koontada gelitaanka kaydka xogta Cacti-gaaga ma laha oggolaansho ay ku gasho kaydka xogta Aagga Saacadda ee MySQL.  Fadlan sii koontada kaydka xogta Cacti oggolaanshaha \"select\" ee shaxda \"time_zone_name\" ee ku jirta kaydka xogta \"mysql\", oo buuxi macluumaadka Aagga Saacadda ee MySQL kahor intaadan sii wadin."

#: lib/installer.php:2124
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Koontada kaydka xogta Cacti-gaagu waxay leedahay oggolaansho ay ku gasho kaydka xogta Aagga Saacadda ee MySQL, kaydka xogtaasna waxaa ka buuxa macluumaadka Aagga Saacadda ee caalamiga ah."

