msgstr "Kor u qaadis laga bilaabo <strong>%s</strong> ilaa <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php:2169
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Haddii ay dhacaan dhibaatooyin, waxaa si xooggan lagula talinayaa inaad nadiifiso kaydka ku meel gaarka ah ee biraawsarkaaga, adigoo xiraya ka dibna dib u furaya biraawsarkaaga (ma aha kaliya tabka Cacti ku jirto) oo isku dayaya mar kale, kahor intaadan arrin u gudbin Kooxda Cacti"

#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Marmar dhif ah, waxaan helnay warbixino ka yimid isticmaalayaasha oo la kulmay dhibaatooyin yaryar sababo la xiriira isbeddelada koodhka.  Dhibaatooyinkan waxaa keena biraawsarka oo haysta koodhkii kor u qaadista kahor, inkastoo aan qaadnay tillaabooyin lagu yaraynayo fursadaha tan, haddana way dhici kartaa.  Haddii aad u baahan tahay tilmaamo ku saabsan sida loo nadiifiyo kaydka ku meel gaarka ah ee biraawsarkaaga, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> waa meel wanaagsan oo laga bilaabo."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Haddii ka dib markaad nadiifiso kaydka ku meel gaarka ah oo aad dib u bilowdo biraawsarkaaga aad weli la kulanto dhibaatooyin, fadlan noo soo gudbi arrinta waxaanan isku dayi doonaa inaan ogaanno sababta keentay."

#: lib/installer.php:2177
