msgstr "Macluumaadka Xiriirka Kaydka Xogta Dhexe"

#: lib/installer.php:2272
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Dejintu Waa Akhris-Kaliya!"

#: lib/installer.php:2274
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Faylkaaga config.php waa inuu noqdaa mid wax laga qori karo oo uu qori karo seerfarka shabakadda inta lagu jiro rakibidda si loo habeeyo poller-ka Fog.  Marka rakibidda la dhammeeyo, waa inaad faylkan ka dhigtaa Akhris-Kaliya si looga hortago dhibaatooyinka amniga ee suurtogalka ah."

#: lib/installer.php:2278
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Dejinta Poller-ka"

#: lib/installer.php:2279
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Macluumaadka Poller-kaaga Fog ee Cacti laguma darin faylkaaga config.php.  Fadlan dib u eeg config.php.dist, oo deji doorsoomayaasha: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, iwm.  Doorsoomayaashan waa in la dejiyaa oo ay dib ugu tilmaamaan seerfarka kaydka xogta Koowaad ee Cacti.  Sax tan oo isku day mar kale."

#: lib/installer.php:2283
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaasha Poller-ka Fog"

#: lib/installer.php:2285
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaasha ay tahay in lagu dejiyo faylka config.php waxaa ka mid ah kuwan soo socda:"

#: lib/installer.php:2296
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Rakibuhu wuxuu si otomaatig ah u qoondeeyaa $poller_id wuxuuna ku daraa faylka config.php."

#: lib/installer.php:2298
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Marka doorsoomayaasha oo dhan lagu dejiyo faylka config.php, waa inaad sidoo kale siisaa $rdatabase_username oggolaansho uu ku galo seerfarka kaydka xogta weyn ee Cacti.  Raac isla habka aad u mari lahayd rakibid kasta oo kale oo Cacti ah.  Ka dib waxaad riixi kartaa badhanka 'Tijaabi Xiriirka'.  Haddii tijaabadu guulaysato waxaad awoodi doontaa inaad sii waddo oo aad dhammaystirto rakibidda."

#: lib/installer.php:2302
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Tillaabooyin Dheeraad ah Rakibidda Ka Dib"

#: lib/installer.php:2304
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Waxaa lama huraan ah in server-ka dhexe ee Cacti uu MySQL ahaan kula xiriiri karo server kasta oo database-ka Cacti ee fog ah. Marka rakibiddu dhammaato, waa inaad wax ka beddeshaa Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog oo aad hubisaa in dejimuhu sax yihiin. Waad xaqiijin kartaa adigoo adeegsanaya 'Tijaabi Xiriirka' marka aad wax ka beddelayso Ururiyaha Xogta ee Fog."

#: lib/installer.php:2317
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Goobaha iyo Noocyada Binary-ga Muhiimka ah"

#: lib/installer.php:2318
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Hubi in dhammaan qiimahani ay sax yihiin ka hor inta aadan sii wadin."

#: lib/installer.php:2321
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Hal ama dhowr dariiq ayaa u muuqda kuwo khaldan, lama sii wadi karo"

#: lib/installer.php:2398
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Hubinta Ogolaanshaha Galka"

#: lib/installer.php:2399
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Fadlan hubi in ogolaanshaha galalka hoose ay sax yihiin ka hor inta aadan sii wadin. Inta lagu jiro rakibidda, galalkani waa inay hoos yimaadaan isticmaalaha Web Server-ka. Isbeddelladan ogolaanshaha waxaa looga baahan yahay si loogu ogolaado Rakibaha inuu rakibo xirmooyinka Qaab-dhismeedka Qalabka oo ay ku jiraan faylasha XML iyo script-yada la dhigi doono galalkan. Haddii aad doorato inaadan rakibin xirmooyinka, waxaa jira script CLI ah oo la yiraahdo 'install_package.php' kaas oo laga isticmaali karo khadka taliska marka rakibiddu dhammaato."

#: lib/installer.php:2402
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Marka rakibiddu dhammaato, waxaad qaar ka mid ah galalkan ka dhigi kartaa kuwo la akhrin karo oo keliya si aad u kordhiso amniga."

#: lib/installer.php:2404
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Galalkani waxay u baahan doonaan inay ahaadaan kuwo la akhrin karo lana qori karo rakibidda ka dib si habka is-waafajinta fog ee Cacti uu u cusboonaysiiyo marka Bogga Webka Ugu Weyn ee Cacti isbeddelo"

#: lib/installer.php:2408
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Haddii aad rakibayso xirmooyin, marka xirmooyinka la rakibo, waa inaad galka script-yada dib ugu celisaa akhris-keliya maadaama tani ay halis u keeni karto bogga webka."

#: lib/installer.php:2410
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Marka la eego ururiyeyaasha fog, waxaa aad muhiim u ah in dariiqyada aad si joogto ah u cusboonaysiin doonto, oo ay ku jiraan dariiqyada plugins, scripts, iyo resources, ay leeyihiin ogolaansho akhris/qoris ah maadaama ururiyaha xogta uu ku qasbanaan doono inuu dariiqyadan ka cusboonaysiiyo waxyaabaha ku jira web server-ka ugu weyn."

#: lib/installer.php:2416
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "La Qori Karo Xilliga Rakibidda Keliya"

#: lib/installer.php:2435 lib/installer.php:2468 lib/installer.php:2476
#: package_import.php:634
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Lama Qori Karo"

