#: lib/installer.php:2533
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Ilaalinta Liiska Caddaan ee Xaqiijinta Gelinta"

#: lib/installer.php:2534
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Hababka Gelinta Xogta Cacti ee u yeera script waxaa looga faa'iidaysan karaa siyaabo qof aan maamule ahayn uu waxyeello ugu geysan karo faylasha uu leeyahay akoonka ururiyaha, iyo xaaladaha qof ku socodsiiyo ururiyaha Cacti sidii root, waxay waxyeellayn kartaa nidaamka hawlgalka taasoo u oggolaanaysa weeraryahannadu inay ka faa'iidaystaan kaabayaashaaga."

#: lib/installer.php:2535
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Sidaa darteed, dhowr nooc ka hor, Cacti waa la horumariyay si ay u bixiso awoodaha Liiska Caddaan ee noocyadan Hababka Gelinta Xogta. Inkastoo tani ay si qoto dheer u sugayso amniga Cacti, haddana waxay kordhisaa shaqada looga baahan yahay maamulaha Cacti si uu u soo dejiyo ugana maamulo Qaab-dhismeedyada iyo Xirmooyinka."

#: lib/installer.php:2536
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Habka uu u shaqeeyo Liiska Caddaan waxa weeye marka aad markii ugu horreysay soo dejiso Habka Gelinta Xogta, ama aad dib u soo dejiso Habka Gelinta Xogta, oo script-ka ama dooduhu (arguments) si uun isku beddelaan, Habka Gelinta Xogta iyo dhammaan Ilaha Xogta ee u dhigma isla markiiba waa la damin doonaa ilaa maamuluhu xaqiijiyo in Habka Gelinta Xogtu sax yahay."

#: lib/installer.php:2537
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Si loo fududeeyo aqoonsiga Hababka Gelinta Xogta ee xaaladdan ku jira, waxaan ku bixinnay script xaqiijin ah oo ku jira galka CLI ee Cacti kaas oo lagu socodsiin karo ikhtiyaarrada soo socda:"

#: lib/installer.php:2541
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarkan script-ka wuxuu raadin doonaa Hab kasta oo Gelinta Xogta ah oo hadda mamnuuc ah wuxuuna bixin doonaa faahfaahinta sababta."

#: lib/installer.php:2542
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarkan script-ka wuxuu ka qaadayaa mamnuucidda Hababka Gelinta Xogta ee hadda mamnuuca ah."

#: lib/installer.php:2543
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarkan script-ka wuxuu dib u shidi doonaa Ilaha Xogta kasta oo damisan."

#: lib/installer.php:2547
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Waxaa si adag lagugula talinayaa inaad cusboonaysiiso faylkaaga config.php si aad u suurtageliso sifadan adigoo faallada ka qaadaya doorsoomaha <b>$input_whitelist</b> ka dibna socodsiinaya saddexda ikhtiyaar ee script-ka CLI ee kore marka rakibidda ku salaysan webka ay dhammaato."

#: lib/installer.php:2549
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqa hoose si aad u qirato inaad akhriday oo aad fahamtay walaacan amniga"

#: lib/installer.php:2551
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Waan akhriyay bayaankan"

