#: lib/utility.php:1150
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ iyo MariaDB 10.0+ waa noocyo aad u wanaagsan, waana noocyo aad u fiican oo la dooran karo. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, hubi inaad ku shaqeyso noocii ugu dambeeyay ee xalliya cillad muddo dheer jirtay oo heer hoose ah oo dhanka shabakadda ah, taas oo Spine ku keeni jirtay dhibaatooyin badan oo dhanka isku-hallaynta ah."

#: lib/utility.php:1162
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Waxaa SI AAD AH lagugula talinayaa inaad daarto InnoDB nooc kasta oo %s ah oo ka weyn 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php:1175 lib/utility.php:1212
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Marka aad Cacti la isticmaalayso luqado aan ahayn Ingiriisi, waxaa muhiim ah inaad isticmaasho nooca kala-sooca ee utf8mb4_unicode_ci maadaama xarfaha qaarkood ay qaataan wax ka badan hal bayt."

#: lib/utility.php:1181 lib/utility.php:1187 lib/utility.php:1218
#: lib/utility.php:1224
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Marka aad Cacti la isticmaalayso luqado aan ahayn Ingiriisi, waxaa muhiim ah inaad isticmaasho xirmada xarfaha ee utf8mb4 maadaama xarfaha qaarkood ay qaataan wax ka badan hal bayt."

#: lib/utility.php:1200
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Waxaa lagugula talinayaa inaad daarto InnoDB nooc kasta oo %s ah oo ka weyn 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php:1233
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Iyadoo ku xiran tirada galitaannada iyo isticmaalka ururiyaha xogta ee Spine, %s wuxuu u baahan doonaa isku-xiryo badan. Xisaabinta Spine waa: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), ka dibna waa inaad u dhaaftaa meel bannaan isku-xiryada isticmaalayaasha, taas oo isbeddeli doonta iyadoo ku xiran tirada akoonnada isku mar soo galaya."

#: lib/utility.php:1238
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ka dhigista kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee jadwalka (table cache) mid weyn waxay ka dhigan tahay hawlgallo yar oo furid/xirid faylal ah marka la isticmaalayo innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php:1243
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo awoodaha ururinta fog (Remote polling), xog badan ayaa laga mideyn doonaa server-ka weyn loona diri doonaa ururiyeyaasha fogfog. Sidaa darteed, qiimahan ku hay 16M ama wax ka sarreeya."

#: lib/utility.php:1249
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Haddii aad isticmaalayso Cacti Performance Booster oo aad doorato matoorka kaydinta xusuusta (memory storage engine), waa inaad ka taxaddartaa inaad nadiifiso kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee Performance Booster ka hor inta uusan nidaamku ka dhammaan meesha bannaan ee jadwalka xusuusta. Tan waxaa lagu sameeyaa laba hab: marka hore waxaa la yareeyaa cabbirka tiirka soo-saarka (output column) ilaa cabbirka saxda ah. Tiirkani wuxuu ku jiraa jadwalada poller_output, iyo poller_output_boost. Waxa labaad ee aad samayn karto waa inaad xusuus badan u qoondayso jadwalada xusuusta. Waxaan si aan ku-talagal ahayn u doorannay qiime lagula talinayo oo ah 10%% ee xusuusta nidaamka, laakiin haddii aad isticmaalayso saxannada SSD, ama aad leedahay nidaam yar, waad iska indho-tiri kartaa taladan ama waxaad dooran kartaa matoor kaydin oo kale. Waxaad ka arki kartaa isticmaalka la filayo ee jadwalada Performance Booster qaybta Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php:1255
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Marka la fulinayo weydiimaha hoose (subqueries), haysashada cabbir jadwal ku-meel-gaar ah oo weyn waxay jadwaladaas ku-meel-gaarka ah ku haysaa xusuusta."

#: lib/utility.php:1261 lib/utility.php:1267
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Marka la samaynayo isku-darka jadwalada (joins), haddii ay ka yar yihiin cabbirkan, waxaa lagu hayn doonaa xusuusta mana lagu qori doono fayl ku-meel-gaar ah. Maadaama tani ay tahay qoondeyn xusuus oo isku-xir kasta ah, waa in laga taxaddaraa inaan aad loo kordhin. Wadarta join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + xusuusta asaasiga ah ee MySQL/MariaDB waa inay ka hoosaysaa 80%. Haddii taladu ay tahay taban (negative), waa inaad yaraysaa tan iyo/ama sort_buffer_size ilaa taladu ay ku habboonaato xusuusta la oggol yahay."

#: lib/utility.php:1273
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta InnoDB waxaa muhiim ah inaad kala soocdo meelaha bannaan ee jadwaladaada (table spaces). Tani waxay maareynta jadwalada u fududaysaa isticmaalayaasha muddada dheer ee %s. Haddii aad hadda ku shaqeyso iyadoo tani dansan tahay, waxaad u guuri kartaa kaydinta fayl-faylka adigoo daaraya astaantan, ka dibna ku socodsiinaya bayaanka alter dhammaan jadwalada InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php:1279
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo innodb_file_per_table, waxaa muhiim ah in innodb_file_format loo dejiyo Barracuda. Dejintani waxay oggolaan doontaa tusmooyin dhaadheer oo muhiim u ah jadwalada qaar ee Cacti."

#: lib/utility.php:1285
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Haddii jadwaladaadu leeyihiin tusmooyin aad u waaweyn, waa inaad ku shaqeysaa innodb_file_format oo ah Barracuda iyo innodb_large_prefix oo u dhigma 1. Ku guuldareysiga samaynta tani waxay keeni kartaa in kordhintu (plugins) aysan si sax ah u abuuri karin jadwalada."

#: lib/utility.php:1291
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB wuxuu xusuusta nidaamka ku hayn doonaa jadwalada iyo tusmooyinka ugu badan ee suurtogalka ah. Sidaa darteed, waa inaad ka dhigtaa innodb_buffer_pool mid ku filan oo xusuusta ku haya inta ugu badan ee jadwalada iyo tusmooyinka. Hubinta cabbirka galka /var/lib/mysql/cacti waxay kaa caawin doontaa go'aaminta qiimahan. Waxaan kugula talinaynaa 25%% oo ka mid ah wadarta xusuusta nidaamkaaga, laakiin baahiyahaagu way kala duwanaan doonaan iyadoo ku xiran cabbirka nidaamkaaga."

#: lib/utility.php:1297
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Dejintani waa inay ahaataa mid DAARAN ilaa ay Cacti-gaagu ku shaqeynayaan ZFS ama FusionI/O midkood, kuwaas oo labaduba leh diiwaangelin gudaha ah (internal journaling) si ay u maareeyaan shilalka kediska ah ee nidaamka. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, haddii aad leedahay koronto aad u wanaagsan, oo nidaamyadaadu ay dhif u damiyaan isla markaana aad haysato kayd-celin (backups), daminta dejintan waxay kuu kordhin kartaa ku dhowaad 50% waxqabadka kaydka xogta (database)."

#: lib/utility.php:1302
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Tani waa halka lagu kaydiyo xogta faahfaahsan (metadata). Haddii aad leedahay jadwalo badan, waxaa faa'iido leh in tan la kordhiyo."

#: lib/utility.php:1307
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Weydiimaha xunxun (rogue queries) ma aha inay sababaan in kaydka xogtu ka baxo khadka dadka kale. Jooji weydiimahan ka hor inta aysan curyaamin nidaamkaaga."

#: lib/utility.php:1312
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Waxqabadka I/O ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu dhacaa marka aad isticmaasho habka O_DIRECT si aad bogagga uga nadiifiso xusuusta."

#: lib/utility.php:1322
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Dejinta qiimahan oo laga dhigo 2 waxay ka dhigan tahay inaad nadiifin doonto dhammaan wax-is-dhaafsiga ilbiriqsi kasta halkii aad ka samayn lahayd marka la xaqiijiyo (commit). Tani waxay u oggolaanaysaa %s inuu qorista sameeyo marar yar."

#: lib/utility.php:1327
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta casriga ah ee nooca SSD, haysashada dunta I/O (io threads) oo badan waxay faa'iido u leedahay barnaamijyada leh sifooyin I/O oo sarreeya."

#: lib/utility.php:1335 lib/utility.php:1377
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Laga bilaabo %s %s, waxaad xakamayn kartaa inta jeer ee %s uu wax-is-dhaafsiga ugu shubo saxanka. Qiimaha caadiga ah waa 1 ilbiriqsi, laakiin nidaamyada I/O-ga sare leh, u dejinta qiime ka weyn 1 waxay u oggolaan kartaa I/O-ga saxanka inuu noqdo mid isku xiga"

#: lib/utility.php:1340
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta casriga ah ee nooca SSD, haysashada dunta I/O ee akhriska oo badan waxay faa'iido u leedahay barnaamijyada leh sifooyin I/O oo sarreeya. Iyadoo ku xiran noocyadaada MariaDB/MySQL, qiimahani wuxuu gaari karaa ilaa 64. Laakiin isku day inaad tirada ka dhigto mid ka yar wadarta dunta SMT ee server-ka kaydka xogta."

#: lib/utility.php:1345
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta casriga ah ee nooca SSD, haysashada dunta I/O ee qorista oo badan waxay faa'iido u leedahay barnaamijyada leh sifooyin I/O oo sarreeya. Iyadoo ku xiran noocyadaada MariaDB/MySQL, qiimahani wuxuu gaari karaa ilaa 64. Laakiin isku day inaad tirada ka dhigto mid ka yar wadarta dunta SMT ee server-ka kaydka xogta."

#: lib/utility.php:1351
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s wuxuu u qaybin doonaa innodb_buffer_pool gobollo xusuus ah si loo wanaajiyo waxqabadka noocyada MariaDB ee ka yar 10.5. Qiimaha ugu sarreeya waa 64, laakiin waa inuusan ka badnaan tirada xudunta/dunta CPU. Marka innodb_buffer_pool uu ka yar yahay 1GB, waa inaad isticmaashaa cabbirka kaydka oo loo qaybiyay 128MB. Sii wad isticmaalka isla'egtan ilaa tirada ugu badan ee xudunta CPU ama 64."

#: lib/utility.php:1351
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s wuxuu u qaybin doonaa innodb_buffer_pool gobollo xusuus ah si loo wanaajiyo waxqabadka noocyada MySQL ilaa iyo oo ay ku jirto MySQL 8.0. Qiimaha ugu sarreeya waa 64, laakiin waa inuusan ka badnaan tirada xudunta/dunta CPU. Marka innodb_buffer_pool uu ka yar yahay 1GB, waa inaad isticmaashaa cabbirka kaydka oo loo qaybiyay 128MB. Sii wad isticmaalka isla'egtan ilaa tirada ugu badan ee xudunta CPU ama 64."

#: lib/utility.php:1357 lib/utility.php:1393
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Haddii aad leedahay saxannada SSD, isticmaal soo-jeedintan. Haddii aad leedahay saxanno adag oo caadi ah (physical hard drives), isticmaal 200 * tirada saxannada shaqeynaya ee ku jira kooxda (array). Haddii la isticmaalayo NVMe ama PCIe Flash, tirooyin aad u waaweyn oo gaaraya ilaa 100000 ayaa la isticmaali karaa."

#: lib/utility.php:1363 lib/utility.php:1399
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Haddii aad leedahay saxannada SSD, isticmaal soo-jeedintan. Haddii aad leedahay saxanno adag oo caadi ah (physical hard drives), isticmaal 2000 * tirada saxannada shaqeynaya ee ku jira kooxda (array). Haddii la isticmaalayo NVMe ama PCIe Flash, tirooyin aad u waaweyn oo gaaraya ilaa 200000 ayaa la isticmaali karaa."

#: lib/utility.php:1369 lib/utility.php:1405
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Haddii aad leedahay saxannada SSD, isticmaal soo-jeedintan. Haddii kale, ha dejin dejintan."

#: lib/utility.php:1382
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta casriga ah ee nooca SSD, haysashada dunta I/O ee akhriska oo badan waxay faa'iido u leedahay barnaamijyada leh sifooyin I/O oo sarreeya."

#: lib/utility.php:1387
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo kaydinta casriga ah ee nooca SSD, haysashada dunta I/O ee qorista oo badan waxay faa'iido u leedahay barnaamijyada leh sifooyin I/O oo sarreeya."

#: lib/utility.php:1418
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo MariaDB 10.2.4 iyo wixii ka sarreeya, dejintani waa inay dansanaataa haddii qorista atomigga (atomic writes) ay daaran tahay. Sidaa darteed, fadlan daar qorista atomigga halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd kaydka labanlaabka ah ee qorista (double write buffer) maadaama ay kordhin doonto waxqabadka."

#: lib/utility.php:1425
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Marka la isticmaalayo MariaDB 10.2.4 iyo wixii ka sarreeya, waxaad isticmaali kartaa qorista atomigga (atomic writes) halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd doublewrite buffer si aad u kordhiso waxqabadka."

