#: user_domains.php:505
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Habka ay Cacti isku dayi doonto inay ku xaqiijiso aqoonsiga server-ka LDAP.<blockquote><i>Raadin La'aan</i> - Ma jiro wax baaritaan ah oo Distinguished Name (DN) ah oo dhaca, kaliya waxay isku daydaa inay ku xirto qaabka Distinguished Name (DN) ee la bixiyay.<br><br><i>Raadin Qarsoon</i> - Waxay isku daydaa inay magaca isticmaalaha ka raadiso diiwaanka LDAP iyadoo adeegsanaysa ku xirid qarsoon si loo helo Distinguished Name (DN) ee isticmaalaha.<br><br><i>Raadin Gaar ah</i> - Waxay isku daydaa inay magaca isticmaalaha ka raadiso diiwaanka LDAP iyadoo adeegsanaysa Distinguished Name (DN) Gaar ah iyo Erayga sirta ah ee Gaarka ah si ay u hesho Distinguished Name (DN) ee isticmaalaha."

#: user_domains.php:555
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Saldhigga raadinta ee lagu baaro diiwaanka LDAP, sida <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> ama <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php:562
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Shaandhada raadinta ee loo adeegsado in lagu helo isticmaalaha diiwaanka LDAP, sida Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> ama OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" waxaa lagu beddelaa magaca isticmaalaha ee la geliyay shaashadda galitaanka."

