#: utilities.php:2351
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Bogga taageerada farsamo ee Cacti.  Waxaa adeegsada horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada taageerada farsamo si ay uga caawiyaan dhibaatooyinka Cacti.  Waxa ku jira hubinta dhibaatooyinka habaynta ee caadiga ah."

#: utilities.php:2355
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Diiwaanka Cacti wuxuu kaydiyaa tirakoobka, khaladaadka iyo fariimaha kale iyadoo ku xiran dejinta nidaamka.  Macluumaadkan waxaa loo adeegsan karaa in lagu garto dhibaatooyinka ururiyaha iyo barnaamijka."

#: utilities.php:2359
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Wuxuu u oggolaanayaa Maamulayaasha inay baaraan diiwaanka isticmaalaha.  Maamulayaashu waxay sidoo kale shaandhayn karaan oo dhoofin karaan diiwaanka."

#: utilities.php:2363
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Maamulka Kaydka Ururiyaha"

#: utilities.php:2366
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Tani waa xogta loo gudbiyo ururiyaha mar kasta oo uu shaqeeyo. Xogtan waxaa markaa la fuliyaa/fasiraa, natiijooyinkana waxaa lagu shubaa faylasha RRD si jaantusyo looga sameeyo ama kaydka xogta si loo soo bandhigo."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Kaydka Weydiinta Xogta wuxuu kaydiyaa macluumaadka laga soo ururiyay noocyada gelinta Weydiinta Xogta. Qiimaha meelahan laga helo waxaa lagu adeegsan karaa meesha qoraalka ee Jaantusyada ee Sharraxaadda (Legends), Calaamadaha Tooska ah, iyo GPRINT iyo sidoo kale CDEF."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Dib u Dhis Kaydka Ururiyaha"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Kaydka Ururiyaha dib ayaa loo abuuri doonaa haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan. Adeegso ikhtiyaarkan oo keliya haddii kaydka xogtu burburo oo aad la kulmayso dhibaatooyin burburka ka dib adigoo hore u socodsiiyay qalabka dayactirka kaydka xogta.  Haddii kale, haddii aad dhibaato kala kulmayso Qalab gaar ah, si fudud dib ugu kaydi Qalabkaas si aad dib ugu dhisto Kaydkiisa Ururiyaha.  Waxaa sidoo kale jira amar u dhigma oo laga bixiyo khadka amarka (CLI) kaas oo lagula talinayo nidaamyada waaweyn."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "FIIRO GAAR AH: Nidaamyada waaweyn, amarkani wuxuu qaadan karaa dhowr daqiiqo ilaa saacado si uu u dhammaado, sidaas darteedna laguma socodsiin karo isdhexgalka Cacti (UI).  Waxaad si fudud khadka amarka uga socodsiin kartaa 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' si aad u hesho macluumaad dheeraad ah."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Dib u Dhis Kaydka Kheyraadka"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Marka la adeegsanayo Ururiyayaal Xog oo badan gudaha Cacti, Cacti waxay isku dayi doontaa inay ilaaliso xaaladda faylasha muhiimka ah ee dhammaan Ururiyayaasha Xogta.  Tani waxay ku jirtaa dhammaan faylasha aasaasiga ah ee mareegaha iyo lifaaqyada (plugins) ee aan la xiriirin rakibaadda.  Marka aad ku khasabto dib-u-dhisidda Kaydka Kheyraadka, Cacti waxay nadiifin doontaa Kaydka Kheyraadka ee maxalliga ah, ka dibna dib ayay u dhisi doontaa bilowga ururiyaha xiga ee qorshaysan.  Tani waxay kicin doontaa dhammaan Ururiyayaasha Xogta ee Fog inay dib u hubiyaan faylasha mareegahooda iyo lifaaqyadooda si ay isugu mid noqdaan."

#: utilities.php:2390
msgid "Boost Utilities"
msgstr "Qalabka Boost"

#: utilities.php:2391
msgid "View Boost Status"
msgstr "Eeg Xaaladda Boost"

#: utilities.php:2393
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Doorashadan liiska ahi waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad aragto dejimaha kala duwan ee boost iyo tirakoobka la xiriira habaynta Boost ee hadda shaqaynaysa."

#: utilities.php:2397
msgid "Data Source Statistics Utilities"
msgstr "Qalabka Tirakoobka Ilaha Xogta"

#: utilities.php:2398
msgid "Purge Data Source Statistics"
msgstr "Faaruqi Tirakoobka Ilaha Xogta"

#: utilities.php:2402
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Doorashadan liiska ahi waxay ka faaruqin doontaa dhammaan Tirakoobka Ilaha Xogta ee jira Kaydka Xogta.  Haddii Tirakoobka Ilaha Xogta la daaro, Tirakoobka Ilaha Xogtu wuxuu bilaabi doonaa ururinta mar kale wareegga xiga ee Ururiyaha Xogta."

#: utilities.php:2407
msgid "RRD Utilities"
msgstr "Qalabka RRD"

#: utilities.php:2408
msgid "RRDfile Cleaner"
msgstr "Nadiifiyaha Faylasha RRD"

#: utilities.php:2411
msgid "When you delete Data Sources from Cacti, the corresponding RRDfiles are not removed automatically.  Use this utility to facilitate the removal of these old files."
msgstr "Marka aad ka tirtirto Ilaha Xogta gudaha Cacti, faylasha RRD ee u dhigma si otomaatig ah looma saaro.  Adeegso qalabkan si aad u fududayso saarista faylashan duugga ah."

#: utilities.php:2416
msgid "Use this utility to display problems with missing rrd files or missing values in rrdfiles. You need enable rrdcheck in Configuration->Settings->Data"
msgstr "Adeegso qalabkan si aad u muujiso dhibaatooyinka faylasha rrd ee maqan ama qiimayaasha ka maqan faylasha rrd. Waxaad u baahan tahay inaad ka daarto rrdcheck gudaha Habaynta->Dejinta->Xogta"

#: utilities.php:2422
msgid "SNMP Agent Utilities"
msgstr "Qalabka Wakiilka SNMP"

#: utilities.php:2426
msgid "This shows all objects being handled by the SNMP Agent."
msgstr "Tani waxay muujinaysaa dhammaan walxaha uu maamulo Wakiilka SNMP."

#: utilities.php:2428
msgid "Rebuild SNMP Agent Cache"
msgstr "Dib u Dhis Kaydka Wakiilka SNMP"

#: utilities.php:2432
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "Kaydka SNMP waa la nadiifin doonaa oo dib ayaa loo abuuri doonaa haddii aad doorato ikhtiyaarkan. Ogow inay qaadanayso wareeg kale oo ururiye ah si buuxda loogu soo celiyo kaydka SNMP."

#: utilities.php:2437
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view the latest events SNMP Agent has handled in relation to the registered notification receivers."
msgstr "Doorashadan liiska ahi waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad aragto dhacdooyinkii ugu dambeeyay ee uu maamulay Wakiilka SNMP ee la xiriira qaateyaasha ogeysiisyada ee diiwaangashan."

